{"id":"be5eece035332f0c","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-strongly-definable-function.md","title":"Strong Definability of a Total Function","display":"df-strongly-definable-function — Strong Definability of a Total Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-strongly-definable-function","aliases":["92-df-strongly-definable-function"],"display":"df-strongly-definable-function — Strong Definability of a Total Function","source":"第 VIII 章 pp. 98–99（PDF 115–116，已核对图像）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-complete-representability]]","[[92-df-formula-instance]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-strongly-definable-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-strongly-definable-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strongly-definable-function — Strong Definability of a Total Function"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VIII 章 pp. 98–99（PDF 115–116，已核对图像）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e5790b58acf0fb1c\" href=\"?note=e5790b58acf0fb1c\" title=\"92-df-complete-representability\">92-df-complete-representability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_k\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_k\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^{k+1}\">\\(\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^{k+1}\\)</span> 来自<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e5790b58acf0fb1c\" href=\"?note=e5790b58acf0fb1c\" title=\"92-df-complete-representability\">92-df-complete-representability</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^{k+1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^{k+1}\\)</span> 来自<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakDef}_{\\mathcal S},\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakDef}_{\\mathcal S},\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}\\)</span> 是下文定义的公式与全函数之间的二元关系。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}definable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{WeakDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^{k+1}(F,\\{(\\vec n,m)\\mid m=f(\\vec n)\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{WeakDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\forall v_k\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Inst}_G^{k+1}(F;\\bar n_0,\\ldots,\\bar n_{k-1},v_k)\n\\to v_k=\\overline{f(\\vec n)}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}definable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{WeakDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^{k+1}(F,\\{(\\vec n,m)\\mid m=f(\\vec n)\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{WeakDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\forall v_k\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Inst}_G^{k+1}(F;\\bar n_0,\\ldots,\\bar n_{k-1},v_k)\n\\to v_k=\\overline{f(\\vec n)}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>强定义额外要求：每个固定标准输入下，系统排除所有其他输出，包括模型中的非标准输出。它不要求系统证明统一全称的总性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\vec x\\exists yF(\\vec x,y)\">\\(\\forall\\vec x\\exists yF(\\vec x,y)\\)</span>，也不等同于仅表示配对后的图码集合。原书对角固定点用的正是这种逐输入强唯一性。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VIII 章 pp. 98–99（PDF 115–116，已核对图像）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-complete-representability","status":"resolved","id":"e5790b58acf0fb1c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-complete-representability]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula-instance]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-complete-representability","status":"resolved","id":"e5790b58acf0fb1c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^{k+1}$ 来自[[92-df-complete-representability]]，$\\mathrm{Inst}_G^{k+1}$ 来自[[92-df-formula-instance]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^{k+1}$ 来自[[92-df-complete-representability]]，$\\mathrm{Inst}_G^{k+1}$ 来自[[92-df-formula-instance]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^{k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^{k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakDef}_{\\mathcal S},\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}definable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{WeakDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^{k+1}(F,\\{(\\vec n,m)\\mid m=f(\\vec n)\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{WeakDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\forall v_k\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Inst}_G^{k+1}(F;\\bar n_0,\\ldots,\\bar n_{k-1},v_k)\n\\to v_k=\\overline{f(\\vec n)}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\vec x\\exists yF(\\vec x,y)","display":false}],"bytes":1967,"backlinks":[{"id":"9252d4105cc5f189","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"27fab6bb26120749","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本条中的旧 $\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ 仍表示正负数码定义。强可定义函数另有内部唯一输出条件，见[[92-df-strongly-definable-function]]；仅配对图码可定义不能直接省去该条件。原书对角函数强可定义性在 p. 102 的 Proposition 4 明确给出。"},{"id":"ca27ed9f018939eb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-strongly-definable-function]] → [[92-thm-strong-definition-pullback]]；[[92-lem-weak-to-strong-function-definition]]利用有限序性质强化函数图定义。强可定义性对每个固定数码输入约束所有输出，不等于一个统一内部总性句。"},{"id":"893064ec9f8dc7f0","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本条